<title>HONG KONG: Berjaya unit to launch US$100 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Berjaya unit to launch US$100 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's Berjaya Group plans to launch a $100 million floating rate note issue via its special purpose company Berjaya Group Capital Cayman Ltd in mid-March, bankers said Thursday.</p>
<p>They said the debut issue will have a tenor of five years.</p>
<p>Chase Manhattan Asia is the arranger.</p>
<p>Roadshows for the FRN will be held in Singapore, Hong Kong, Taipei, Tokyo and Seoul starting next Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
